Yeah.
是啊。

84
00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:51.950
Not thwarted.
不是“阻挠”。

85
00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:52.570
Hmm.
嗯。

86
00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:52.970
Hmm.
嗯。

87
00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.310
Something to think about.
值得思考一下。

88
00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.190
Something to think about.
值得思考一下。

89
