我们的最后一季。

92
00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:05.830
Yes.
是的。

93
00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:10.850
We shared about this in our book, The Office BFFs, but I'll never forget it.
我们在书《办公室闺蜜》里分享过这件事，但我永远不会忘记。

94
00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.990
It's such a clear memory for me.
那段记忆对我来说非常清晰。

95
00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.350
We were sitting in the bus.
我们当时正坐在巴士里。

96
00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.410
It was in the parking lot.
就在停车场里。

97
00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:16.790
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

98
00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:23.050
We had all piled in there, and Greg came on the bus, and I wasn't expecting to see him
我们都挤在里面，格雷格上了车，我没想到那天会见到他，

99
00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:29.210
that day, and he asked if it could just be the cast on the bus, and there was a few crew
他问能不能只留演员在车上，当时有几个工作人员

100
00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:34.030
members that were kind of getting the bus ready for us to hit the open road, and they
正在为我们出发上路做准备，他们

101
