这会是什么消息呢？

118
00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:10.130
Yeah.
是啊。

119
00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:15.990
And then he just explained to us that, you know, NBC was wanting to do maybe two more
然后他向我们解释说，NBC电视台可能想再做

120
00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:20.430
years of the show, but at that time, people's contracts were going to be expiring before
两年的节目，但当时大家的合同在那之前就要到期了，

121
00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:25.950
then, and we might lose some of our cast, and then what was the show if it wasn't all
我们可能会失去一些演员，如果不是我们所有人都在，那这剧还是原来的样子吗？

122
00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:26.790
of us, right?
对吧？

123
00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:27.210
Yeah.
是啊。

124
00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:33.670
He was like, do we want to call our own out and go out our way, or do we want to slowly
他说，我们是想主动选择结束，还是想看着演员们慢慢

