剧组常驻成员，而德文离开了。

156
00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:08.390
He was going to do a play in New York.
他要去纽约演一部戏。

157
00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:13.390
But Creed said, I want Devin to come back, and I want to be able to play a song on the
但克里德说，我希望德文能回来，而且我想在

158
00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:13.670
show.
剧里弹一首歌。

159
00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.610
And we made both those things happen.
