00:29:02.660 --> 00:29:09.400
Laverne's Apple Pies, Laverne's Apple Pies and others, and Laverne's Pies, no cakes, don't ask.
“拉文苹果派”、“拉文苹果派及其他”以及“拉文派店，不卖蛋糕，别问为什么”。

