00:30:20.460 --> 00:30:25.860
Microsoft office in China that had introduced something called the Enterprise bus, which was
中国的一家微软办公室引入了一种叫“企业巴士”的东西，其实就是

695
00:30:25.860 --> 00:30:29.540
just a bus with work desks in it.
一辆里面装了办公桌的巴士。

696
00:30:29.700 --> 00:30:33.700
So the laborers had to continue working, even on their way to work.
所以员工在去上班的路上也得继续工作。

697
00:30:33.820 --> 00:30:36.320
And it just seems so demoralizing.
这看起来太让人沮丧了。

698
00:30:36.320 --> 00:30:40.120
And we thought, God, Dwight would love this.
我们当时想，天哪，德怀特一定会喜欢这个。

699
00:30:40.860 --> 00:30:42.960
And work bus was born.
于是工作巴士就诞生了。

700
00:30:44.020 --> 00:30:44.960
I love it.
我太喜欢这个了。

701
00:30:45.100 --> 00:30:46.660
The Enterprise bus.
企业号巴士。

702
00:30:46.900 --> 00:30:47.240
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

703
00:30:47.760 --> 00:30:48.140
Wow.
哇。

704
00:30:48.560 --> 00:30:49.600
I didn't know that.
我以前不知道。

705
00:30:49.760 --> 00:30:52.220
All these years, I didn't know that's where this idea came from.
这么多年了，我竟然不知道这个点子是这么来的。

706
00:30:52.460 --> 00:30:52.900
Me either.
我也不知道。

707
00:30:53.200 --> 00:30:54.460
I do have a question.
我确实有个问题。

708
00:30:54.700 --> 00:30:54.880
Yeah.
嗯。

709
00:30:54.900 --> 00:30:59.180
As I watched this bus pull into the parking lot, and the Dunder Mifflin crew walks out to
当我看到这辆巴士开进停车场，邓德·米夫林的员工们走出来

