00:30:59.180 --> 00:31:02.580
see the bus and get on it, I thought, what about the other businesses?
看到巴士并上车时，我在想，其他公司怎么办？

711
00:31:02.580 --> 00:31:06.280
Is Vance Refrigeration going to have to operate on its own work bus?
万斯制冷公司也得有他们自己的工作巴士吗？

