00:31:12.520 --> 00:31:15.980
why didn't Dwight have to provide a work bus for the five families?
为什么德怀特不需要为那五家公司提供工作巴士？

715
00:31:16.280 --> 00:31:17.760
I thought that immediately.
我当时也立刻想到了这点。

716
00:31:18.100 --> 00:31:23.860
I had a question, which is, why is it Dwight's call whether or not we keep working while he
我有个问题，就是为什么在他解决这个问题的时候，

