Like, you could forward your calls, right?
比如，你可以呼叫转移，对吧？

730
00:31:43.100 --> 00:31:45.220
I think that technology existed.
我想当时是有这种技术的。

731
00:31:45.220 --> 00:31:47.100
Could you forward it to your house?
你能转接到家里吗？

