I know you could forward calls within your phone system in the office.
我知道你可以在办公室的电话系统内进行呼叫转移。

733
00:31:52.640 --> 00:31:58.520
Like, if Pam wanted to go work back by HR, she could forward her calls to a desk back there.
比如，如果帕姆想去人力资源部那边办公，她可以把电话转接到那边的桌子上。

734
00:31:58.700 --> 00:32:01.940
But can you forward them to your house?
但你能转接到家里吗？

735
00:32:01.960 --> 00:32:02.160
No.
不能。

736
00:32:02.360 --> 00:32:02.700
I don't know.
我不知道。

737
00:32:02.780 --> 00:32:03.540
There was all those things.
当时有各种各样的小功能。

738
00:32:03.620 --> 00:32:07.140
Remember how if you hit star 86, you could see who just tried to call you.
记得吗，如果你按星号86，就能看到刚才谁给你打过电话。

739
00:32:07.300 --> 00:32:08.660
Like, if someone called you and hung up.
比如，如果有人打给你然后挂断了。

740
00:32:08.780 --> 00:32:09.260
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

741
00:32:09.280 --> 00:32:10.080
On your landline?
在座机上？

742
00:32:10.160 --> 00:32:10.860
On your landline.
在座机上。

743
00:32:10.860 --> 00:32:12.220
You could hit, like, star something.
你可以按，比如，星号加什么数字。

744
00:32:12.400 --> 00:32:14.180
I remember that was, like, a big thing in high school.
我记得那在我高中时是一件大事。

745
00:32:14.440 --> 00:32:15.220
Hit star whatever.
按星号加什么来着。

746
