So I was having all this static on my home line whenever I tried to use it.
所以我家里的电话线一用就有杂音。

756
00:32:43.840 --> 00:32:45.120
We never use it.
我们平时根本不用它。

757
00:32:45.120 --> 00:32:52.940
It's literally there for my anxious, brains, gloom and doom-oriented future thinking of
它纯粹是为了我那焦虑、悲观、总爱设想末日的脑回路而存在的，

758
00:32:52.940 --> 00:32:55.960
this time when I'm going to need to call 911 and not speak.
为了应对那种我需要拨打911却无法开口的情况。

759
00:32:56.440 --> 00:32:57.920
We pay for this landline.
我们一直付着座机费。

760
