That also surprises me because I think Josh and I are wired similarly.
这让我很惊讶，因为我觉得我和Josh的思维方式很像。

770
00:33:12.980 --> 00:33:14.240
So I am surprised.
所以我很意外。

771
00:33:14.780 --> 00:33:16.600
I don't even know my home number.
我甚至都不知道我家的座机号码。

772
