It wasn't a true landline.
那根本不是真正的座机。

780
00:33:39.020 --> 00:33:42.320
And they tried to tell me they couldn't give me a real landline.
他们还试图告诉我，他们没法提供真正的座机线路。

781
00:33:42.480 --> 00:33:45.440
And I argued with them for days.
我和他们争论了好几天。

782
00:33:46.120 --> 00:33:48.340
And finally, you got a true landline.
最后，你终于装上了真正的座机。

783
00:33:48.360 --> 00:33:49.280
I got a true landline.
我装上了真正的座机。

784
00:33:49.380 --> 00:33:53.600
But it was with much effort because they want to like bundle you or they want to like
但费了很大劲，因为他们总想让你捆绑套餐，或者想让你

