1753
01:15:07.170 --> 01:15:10.250
Because it smells, I feel like it's, I can smell exhauSt.
因为有味道，我觉得，我能闻到尾气味。

1754
01:15:10.490 --> 01:15:10.730
Yeah.
没错。

1755
01:15:10.930 --> 01:15:11.830
Something is wrong.
出问题了。

1756
01:15:11.950 --> 01:15:12.770
Something is wrong.
肯定出问题了。

1757
01:15:12.910 --> 01:15:14.450
