1764
01:15:28.730 --> 01:15:31.190
So then Bryan Cranston comes on the bus.
然后布莱恩·科兰斯顿上了车。

1765
01:15:31.350 --> 01:15:36.750
He gets a chair, he pulls it over, and he stands on the chair and puts his face right
他拿了把椅子，拉过来，站上去，把脸直接凑到

1766
